  "translation": "蘸酱应冷食，而馅料则应滚烫。"
}

{
  "translation": "Dip the sauce cold, but the filling should be piping hot."
}

{
  "translation": "罐子里装的是腌酸豆，而不是青胡椒。"
}

{
  "translation": "There are preserved cassia buds in the jar, not green peppercorns."
}

{
  "translation": "在混合酱汁之前，请去掉月桂叶。"
}

{
  "translation": "这汤在没加任何调料之前就已经很咸了。"
}

{
  "translation": "Store the pickled vegetables in the refrigerator until they are ready to be served."
}

{
  "translation": "该食谱要求使用无糖可可粉，而非饮用巧克力。"
}
